+ * The S7 remote control: com.hakios.ready. The alert goes first (it is the super-modal one), then
+ * the switcher, then, only when the UI is not locked, the cover sheet. `unlock_if_locked` is true
+ * for the late automatic run and for the self-test's requests (long after the +10 s unlock) and
+ * false for the +6 s one, which must not race SpringBoard's own startup unlock.
+ */
+static void
